#: src/postulo/templates/settings/accessibility.html
#, python-format
msgid "Postulo is checked against WCAG 2.2 at level AA, in both themes, at 320 pixels and under Windows High Contrast; reduced motion and more contrast follow your system's own setting. What is checked, what is known not to work yet, and how to tell us when something does not work for you is on the <a href=\"%(guide)s\" class=\"underline\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer external\" target=\"_blank\">Accessibility page<span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>."
msgstr "Postulo се проверава према WCAG 2.2 на нивоу AA, у обе теме, на 320 пиксела и уз Windows High Contrast; смањено кретање и већи контраст прате подешавање вашег система. Шта се проверава, шта је познато да још не ради и како да нам јавите када вам нешто не ради, налази се на <a href=\"%(guide)s\" class=\"underline\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer external\" target=\"_blank\">страници о приступачности<span class=\"sr-only\"> (отвара се у новој картици)</span></a>."

#: src/postulo/templates/help/links.html
msgid "Postulo never opens a link on its own: not to check that it answers, not for an icon, not for a picture. The address is kept as you typed it, with https:// put in front where you left it out."
